  "descripcion": "History, legend, and sci-fi collide in the latest chapter of the Fate/EXTRA saga! Join 26 Heroic Spirits from all across time as they hack and slash their way across the battlefields of SE.RA.PH, a digital realm for the last survivors of Earth.",
  "generos": [
    "Acción"
  ],
  "lanzamientoTexto": "19 MAR 2019",
